{"level":"debug","message":"ToolResult created","result":{"output":"{\n  \"query\": \"What are the different types of solar energy (e.g., photovoltaic, thermal)?\",\n  \"total_results\": 9,\n  \"search_time\": 1.764,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"How Does Solar Work?\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.energy.gov/eere/solar/how-does-solar-work\",\n      \"snippet\": \"There are two main types of solar energy technologies—photovoltaics (PV) and concentrating solar-thermal power (CSP). Photovoltaics Basics.\",\n      \"domain\": \"energy.gov\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Dec 3, 2019\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.9,\n      \"source_authority\": 9,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar Energy – SEIA\",\n      \"url\": \"https://seia.org/initiatives/about-solar-energy/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"There are three main ways to harness solar energy: photovoltaics, solar heating & cooling, and concentrating solar power. Photovoltaics. Photovoltaic (PV) ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"seia.org\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.7,\n      \"source_authority\": 6,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar Photovoltaic vs. Solar Thermal: Understanding the ...\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.ecoflow.com/za/blog/solar-photovoltaic-vs-solar-thermal\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Solar PV converts sunlight to electricity, while solar thermal uses heat-transfer fluid to capture heat for heating. PV uses semiconductors, thermal uses fluid.\",\n      \"domain\": \"ecoflow.com\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 1,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"What Are the Different Types of Solar Energy?\",\n      \"url\": \"https://solartogether.co.uk/blog/what-are-the-different-types-solar-energy/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"There are three main types of solar energy: photovoltaic (PV), solar thermal, and passive solar gain. PV panels use the sun's light to generate electricity, ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"solartogether.co.uk\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.95,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"The Two Types of Solar Energy.\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.planete-energies.com/en/media/article/two-types-solar-energy\",\n      \"snippet\": \"The two types of solar energy are photovoltaic, which converts sunlight into electricity, and solar thermal, which captures the sun's heat.\",\n      \"domain\": \"planete-energies.com\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Feb 2, 2024\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.85,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Types of solar power plants: PV, Thermal, and Towers\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.p4q.com/types-of-solar-power-plants/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"The types of solar power plants are: Photovoltaic, Conventional flat solar collector, Vacuum solar collector, Thermal solar plants, and Solar Power Tower.\",\n      \"domain\": \"p4q.com\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.75,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"How does solar power work?\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.nationalgrid.com/stories/energy-explained/how-does-solar-power-work\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Solar PV panels generate electricity, as described above, while solar thermal panels generate heat. While the energy source is the same – the ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"nationalgrid.com\",\n      \"published_date\": \"May 16, 2023\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.8,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar Photovoltaic (PV) vs Solar Thermal (2025)\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.renewableenergyhub.co.uk/main/solar-panels/photovoltaic-vs-solar-thermal\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Solar PV provides electricity, while solar thermal generates heat, typically for hot water. Solar thermal is more space efficient and less ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"renewableenergyhub.co.uk\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Dec 31, 2024\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.6,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Different types of solar panels and how they work\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.repsol.com/en/energy-move-forward/energy/types-of-solar-panels/index.cshtml\",\n      \"snippet\": \"The three main types of solar panels are photovoltaic, which generate electricity; thermal, which generate heat; and hybrid, which combine both.\",\n      \"domain\": \"repsol.com\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.6499999999999999,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"suggestions\": [\n    \"What are the different types of solar energy (e.g., photovoltaic, thermal)? definition\",\n    \"What are the different types of solar energy (e.g., photovoltaic, thermal)? examples\",\n    \"What are the different types of solar energy (e.g., photovoltaic, thermal)? 2024\",\n    \"What are the different types of solar energy (e.g., photovoltaic, thermal)? research\",\n    \"What are the different types of solar energy (e.g., photovoltaic, thermal)? analysis\"\n  ],\n  \"search_engines_used\": [\n    \"serpapi\"\n  ]\n}"},"timestamp":"2025-10-01 09:50:14"}
