ar cells, it knocks electrons loose, setting them in motion and creating a flow of ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"energysage.com\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Aug 6, 2024\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.6,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"How Do Solar Panels Work?\",\n      \"url\": \"https://relionbattery.com/blog/how-do-solar-panels-work?srsltid=AfmBOopgUOt3M5iuqVVNgd08b1K-Gy6JPKk7A0FHEcn2zDjM9g1oOfZC\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Sunlight hits the solar panels · The panels then convert the sunlight into electricity, moving through the array to the conductive wire · The ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"relionbattery.com\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Jul 7, 2022\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.6499999999999999,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"suggestions\": [\n    \"How does solar energy conversion work? definition\",\n    \"How does solar energy conversion work? examples\",\n    \"How does solar energy conversion work? 2024\",\n    \"How does solar energy conversion work? research\",\n    \"How does solar energy conversion work? analysis\"\n  ],\n  \"search_engines_used\": [\n    \"serpapi\"\n  ]\n}"},"timestamp":"2025-10-01 09:51:04"}
