{"level":"debug","message":"ToolResult created","result":{"output":"{\n  \"query\": \"What are the benefits and drawbacks of using solar energy?\",\n  \"total_results\": 8,\n  \"search_time\": 2.556,\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar Power 101: Advantages & Disadvantages\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.environmentalscience.org/solar-power-101\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Solar panels aren't very good at converting sunlight to electricity - most solar panels have at best a 20% efficiency rate (7) And their costs are high. For a ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"environmentalscience.org\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.8,\n      \"source_authority\": 10,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Solar Energy: Benefits and Drawbacks\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.investopedia.com/articles/investing/053015/pros-and-cons-solar-energy.asp\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Using solar energy for your home will save you money, increase your home value, help you become energy independent, and will decrease your ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"investopedia.com\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Nov 2, 2024\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.9,\n      \"source_authority\": 7,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Pros and Cons\",\n      \"url\": \"https://energy4me.org/learn-about-energy/energy-sources/solar/pros-and-cons/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Solar energy produces no air or water pollution or greenhouse gases. However, it has some indirect impacts on the environment.\",\n      \"domain\": \"energy4me.org\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.75,\n      \"source_authority\": 6,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"The Advantages and Disadvantages of Solar Energy\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.constellation.com/energy-101/energy-innovation/solar-energy-pros-and-cons.html\",\n      \"snippet\": \"1. Solar energy is a renewable energy source and reduces carbon emissions · 2. ​​Solar energy can reduce your home's electricity bill · 3. Solar power can get you ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"constellation.com\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 1,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Pros and Cons of Solar Energy: 2025 Expert Guide\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.solarreviews.com/blog/pros-and-cons-of-solar-energy\",\n      \"snippet\": \"1. Solar is a sustainable and renewable energy source · 2. Solar energy is environmentally friendly · 3. Solar energy provides electricity bill savings · 4. Solar ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"solarreviews.com\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.85,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"17 Advantages & Disadvantages of Solar Energy ...\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.greenmatch.co.uk/solar-energy/pros-and-cons\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Reduces Electricity Bills, Weather Dependent ; Diverse Applications, Solar Energy Storage is Expensive ; Low Maintenance Costs, Uses a Lot of ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"greenmatch.co.uk\",\n      \"published_date\": \"Feb 19, 2025\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.7,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"The Pros and Cons of Solar Energy\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.bigdogsolar.com/solar-school/the-pros-and-cons-of-solar-energy\",\n      \"snippet\": \"Like any good investment, solar energy has a payback period. The financial benefits accrue over time through savings on your energy bills, and not instantly.\",\n      \"domain\": \"bigdogsolar.com\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.6499999999999999,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Pros And Cons of Solar Panels: They're Usually Worth It\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.energysage.com/solar/advantages-and-disadvantages-of-solar-energy/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"1. It lowers your electric bills, 1. It doesn't work for every roof ; 2. It can improve your home value, 2. It might not be worth it if you're moving soon ; 3. It ...\",\n      \"domain\": \"energysage.com\",\n      \"relevance_score\": 0.6,\n      \"source_authority\": 5.5,\n      \"search_engine\": \"serpapi\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"suggestions\": [\n    \"What are the benefits and drawbacks of using solar energy? definition\",\n    \"What are the benefits and drawbacks of using solar energy? examples\",\n    \"What are the benefits and drawbacks of using solar energy? 2024\",\n    \"What are the benefits and drawbacks of using solar energy? research\",\n    \"What are the benefits and drawbacks of using solar energy? analysis\"\n  ],\n  \"search_engines_used\": [\n    \"serpapi\"\n  ]\n}"},"timestamp":"2025-10-01 09:51:52"}
